      "ref": "TMR1995/r22.20(7)",
      "style": "subsection",
      "text": "(7) The repeal and substitution of regulation 21.10 made by Part 2 of Schedule 2 to the Intellectual Property Laws Amendment (Productivity Commission Response Part 1 and Other Measures) Regulations 2018 applies in relation to withdrawals occurring on or after the commencement of that Part."
